     logger.info(\n            \"##### Phase-adaptive prefill-alt codec = %s (decode keeps %s)%s\",\n            args.prefill_alt_comp,\n            args.split_compressor or args.weight_comp or \"zipserv\",\n            f\"; max-chunk={args.prefill_alt_max_chunk}\"\n            if args.prefill_alt_max_chunk else \"\")\n    if args.kv_comp:\n        logger.info(\n            \"##### Using KV Compression (backend=%s, producer=%s)\",\n            args.kv_comp,\n            os.environ.get(\"TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PRODUCER\",\n                           \"backend-default\"))\n        if os.environ.get(\"TIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY\", \"0\") == \"1\":\n            logger.info(\n                \"##### KV full-block-only enabled \"\n                \"(partial tails stay in HBM)\")\n    if split_weight or split_kv:\n        logger.info(\n            \"##### Mantissa/Exponent SPLIT enabled (weight_split=%s, \"\n            \"kv_split=%s, weight=%s, kv=%s, kv_codec=%s)\",\n            split_weight, split_kv, args.weight_comp, args.kv_comp,\n            os.environ.get(\"TIERED_SERVE_KV_MANT_CODEC\", \"dietgpu\"))\n    logger.info(\n        \"##########################################################################\"\n    )\n\n    engine_args = AsyncEngineArgs.from_cli_args(args)\n    for name, attr in args.__dict__.items():\n        engine_args.__setattr__(name, attr)\n    engine_args.disable_log_requests = True\n    engine_args.enforce_eager = False\n    engine_args.max_num_seqs = min(args.max_num_seqs, 512) if args.max_num_seqs is not None else 512\n    engine_args.enable_prefix_caching = False\n    engine_args.enable_chunked_prefill = True\n    engine_args.max_num_batched_tokens = 1024\n    engine_args.max_model_len = args.max_context_len\n    engine_args.swap_space = 0\n    engine_args.block_size = 16\n\n    # Cap CUDA-graph capture at the expected decode batch size (in requests)\n    # so that any batch whose token count exceeds it — i.e. one carrying a\n    # non-trivial prefill chunk — runs EAGER (CUDAGraphMode.NONE) and takes\n    # the dedicated eager prefill weight path, instead of a PIECEWISE graph.\n    # Pure decode (num_tokens == num_reqs) up to this many requests stays\n    # fully graph-captured.  Tune _DECODE_CAPTURE_REQS to the real decode\n    # concurrency: too low and large decode bursts fall to eager; too high\n    # and more prefill-mixed batches sneak into piecewise graphs (still\n    # correct via DualMemoryLoader.batch_has_prefill, just not eager).\n    # Scaled by the per-decode-step query length so speculative decoding\n    # (decode num_tokens = num_reqs * (1 + num_spec)) is not pushed eager.\n    from vllm.config import CompilationConfig\n    # !!IMPOPRTANT: Batch SOULD NO MORE THAN THIS VALUE\n    # THIS VALUE IS FOR REDUCE CUDA GRAPH MEMRORY CONSUMPTION\n    # IF BATCH SIZE IS LARGER THAN _DECODE_CAPTURE_REQS OFFLOAD WILL NOT WORK\n    _DECODE_CAPTURE_REQS = 512\n\n    _decode_query_len = 1\n    _spec = getattr(engine_args, \"speculative_config\", None)\n    if isinstance(_spec, dict):\n        _ns = _spec.get(\"num_speculative_tokens\")\n        if _ns:\n            _decode_query_len += int(_ns)\n    _cc = engine_args.compilation_config\n    if not isinstance(_cc, CompilationConfig):\n        # the args-copy loop above may have replaced it with a raw CLI value\n        # (None / int level / dict); normalize back to a CompilationConfig.\n        if isinstance(_cc, int):\n            _cc = CompilationConfig(level=_cc)\nABI 확인은 [구조 가이드](LANDING_GUIDE.md)를 따른다.\n\n## 2. Server 시작\n\n### 2.1 70B fused weight + KV compression\n\n`all-frozen-split-p4`와 `--fused-mm`을 함께 쓰면 P4Flat weight override를\n실제로 설치하면서 KV offload/compression도 사용하는 70B profile이 된다.\n\n```bash\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python serve_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs cao-p4-fused \\\n```\n\nWeight placement을 바꾸고 싶다면 다음 profile을 사용한다.\n\n| 모델 | Config | Weight 실행 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 70B | `flexgen` | even HBM + odd raw weight offload |\n| 70B | `flexgen-comp-p4` | even HBM + odd P4Flat weight offload + dense decompress |\n| 70B | `all-frozen-split-p4` | `--fused-mm` 사용 시 P4Flat split-storage override |\n\nRaw config에서는 `--weight-comp p4flat`과 `--fused-mm`을 빼고, KV compression을 끄려면\n`--kv-comp p4flat`만 뺀다. KV offload까지 끄려면 두 번째 변경과 함께\n`--no-offload-kv`를 추가한다. `--no-offload-kv --kv-comp ...` 조합은\n허용되지 않는다.\n\nWeight placement는 CLI가 아니라 YAML residency가 결정한다. `--weight-comp`\n또는 `--kv-comp`는 값을 생략하면 `zipserv`, flag 자체를 생략하면 OFF다.\n`--ts-configs`는 필수이고 여러 값을 주면 첫 config가 primary env/log stem이\n된다. `--fused-mm`은 weight-only 요청이며 compression을 켜지 않는다. KV는\nraw 또는 compressed LPDDR에서 dense HBM으로 복원된 뒤 FlashAttention이 읽는다.\n\n## 3. Launcher가 고정하는 값\n\nServing CLI의 일부 vLLM 옵션은 launcher가 engine 생성 직전에 다음처럼\n고정한다.\n\n| Engine 값 | Serving 동작 |\n|---|---|\n| Process topology | API frontend와 EngineCore child 분리; child 안은 `UniProcExecutor` |\n| `block_size` | `16` |\n| `swap_space` | `0` |\n| `enforce_eager` | `False` |\n| `max_model_len` | `--max-context-len` |\n| `max_num_batched_tokens` | chunked prefill이면 `8192`, 아니면 context length |\n| `max_num_seqs` | 요청값, 미지정 시 `512`, 최대 `512` |\n| compile cache | 매 run 비활성화 |\n| request body logging | 비활성화 |\n| KV staging buffers | `2` |\n\n따라서 context는 `--max-context-len`, concurrency는 `--max-num-seqs`,\nprefill 정책은 `--chunked-prefill` 또는 `--no-chunked-prefill`로 설정한다.\n지원 기준은 BF16, TP=1, prefix caching off다.\n\n### 3.1 Dedicated KV block 계산\n\n`TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS`와\n`TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB`를 모두 unset하면 서버가 시작 시점의\n가용 HBM, runtime reserve, resident-tail, LPDDR 용량을 기준으로 dedicated\nKV block 수를 자동 계산한다.\n\n고정 비교가 필요할 때만 둘 중 하나를 설정한다. `BLOCKS` 값은 scheduler가\n보는 논리 KV block 수이며 resident-tail row는 내부에서 별도로 더한다. 명시한\n값이 HBM 한도를 넘으면 값이 조용히 줄어들지 않고 서버 시작이 실패하면서\n요청값과 가능한 최댓값을 출력한다.\n\n```bash\n# 자동 계산\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\n\n# 논리 KV block 수를 정확히 요청\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=2432 \\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\n  numactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python serve_offload_kvweight.py ...\n```\n\n## 4. API smoke\n\nServer가 model load와 graph capture를 끝낸 뒤 별도 terminal에서 실행한다.\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/health\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/models\n\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"model\": \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\",\n    \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"}],\n    \"temperature\": 0,\n    \"max_tokens\": 16\n  }'\n```\n\n8B server에는 request의 `model`도 8B ID로 바꾼다. `--served-model-name`을\n사용했다면 그 alias를 넣는다. `/v1/completions`도 지원한다. `--api-key`를 사용했다면\nOpenAI API 요청에 `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header를 추가한다. 외부\n접속이 필요하지 않으면 `127.0.0.1` bind를 유지한다.\n\n+    TTFT_SLO_MS = 2000.0\n+    TPOT_SLO_200_MS = 200.0\n+    TPOT_SLO_250_MS = 250.0\n+\n+    def _pcts(data: list[float]) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n+        if not data:\n+            return (0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n+        arr = np.array(data)\n+        return (\n+            float(np.percentile(arr, 50)),\n+            float(np.percentile(arr, 90)),\n+            float(np.percentile(arr, 95)),\n+            float(np.percentile(arr, 99)),\n+        )\n+\n+    ttft_p50, ttft_p90, ttft_p95, ttft_p99 = _pcts(ttfts_ms)\n+    tpot_p50, tpot_p90, tpot_p95, tpot_p99 = _pcts(tpots_ms)\n+    itl_p50, itl_p90, itl_p95, itl_p99 = _pcts(itls_ms)\n+    e2el_p50, e2el_p90, e2el_p95, e2el_p99 = _pcts(e2els_ms)\n+\n+    n_total = len(successful)\n+    prefill_att = (\n+        sum(1 for t in ttfts_ms if t <= TTFT_SLO_MS) / n_total * 100\n+        if n_total else 0.0\n+    )\n+    decode_200_att = (\n+        sum(1 for t in tpots_ms if t <= TPOT_SLO_200_MS) / n_